{"parentId":"64454845","spaceId":"64454658","ownerId":"6359f8d1928dc277b90524ae","lastOwnerId":null,"createdAt":"2025-10-10T10:39:06.994Z","authorId":"6359f8d1928dc277b90524ae","parentType":"page","position":826,"version":{"number":1,"message":"","minorEdit":false,"authorId":"6359f8d1928dc277b90524ae","createdAt":"2025-10-10T10:39:06.994Z","ncsStepVersion":"1"},"status":"current","body":{"storage":{"representation":"storage","value":"<h1>IDE Phoenix - Comprehensive Test Cases Documentation</h1><h2>📋 Document Information</h2><table data-layout="default"><tbody><tr><th><p>Property</p></th><th><p>Value</p></th></tr><tr><td><p><strong>Application</strong></p></td><td><p>IDE Phoenix - Telecom Order Management System</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>Version</strong></p></td><td><p>Rails 8.0</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>Created Date</strong></p></td><td><p>2025-10-10</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>Last Updated</strong></p></td><td><p>2025-10-10</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>Status</strong></p></td><td><p>✅ Active</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>Owner</strong></p></td><td><p>QA Team</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>Repository</strong></p></td><td><p><code>/ide-phoenix/TEST_CASES.md</code></p></td></tr></tbody></table><hr /><h2>📖 Table of Contents</h2><ol start="1"><li><p><a href="#test-plan-overview">Test Plan Overview</a></p></li><li><p><a href="#test-strategy">Test Strategy</a></p></li><li><p><a href="#test-environment-setup">Test Environment Setup</a></p></li><li><p><a href="#test-data-requirements">Test Data Requirements</a></p></li><li><p><a href="#test-case-categories">Test Case Categories</a></p></li><li><p><a href="#detailed-test-cases">Detailed Test Cases</a></p></li><li><p><a href="#automation-recommendations">Automation Recommendations</a></p></li><li><p><a href="#test-execution-schedule">Test Execution Schedule</a></p></li></ol><hr /><h2>🎯 Test Plan Overview</h2><h3>Application Summary</h3><p>IDE Phoenix is a <strong>Rails 8</strong> telecom service order management application featuring:</p><ul><li><p>✅ <strong>Multi-role authentication</strong>: Admin, Sales, Customer, Verificator</p></li><li><p>🔄 <strong>Order lifecycle management</strong>: Customer &rarr; MSISDN &rarr; Verification &rarr; Payment &rarr; Delivery &rarr; Activation</p></li><li><p>📱 <strong>MSISDN selection</strong>: FIFO auto-population with manual override</p></li><li><p>📄 <strong>Document verification workflow</strong>: Upload, review, approve/reject</p></li><li><p>💳 <strong>Payment processing</strong>: Multiple payment gateways with webhook integration</p></li><li><p>⚙️ <strong>Background job processing</strong>: Sidekiq for async operations</p></li><li><p>🔌 <strong>External integrations</strong>: SFTP, Dukcapil API, Payment gateways, Google Cloud Storage</p></li></ul><h3>Test Objectives</h3><ol start="1"><li><p>✅ Validate all user workflows across different roles</p></li><li><p>✅ Ensure order lifecycle transitions work correctly</p></li><li><p>✅ Verify MSISDN/ICCID reservation and allocation logic</p></li><li><p>✅ Validate document upload and approval workflows</p></li><li><p>✅ Test payment integration and webhook handling</p></li><li><p>✅ Verify background job execution</p></li><li><p>✅ Test external service integrations</p></li><li><p>✅ Validate security and authorization rules</p></li><li><p>✅ Ensure data integrity across multi-database setup</p></li><li><p>✅ Verify performance under bulk operations</p></li></ol><hr /><h2>📊 Test Case Summary</h2><h3>Total Test Cases: <strong>210</strong></h3><h4>By Category:</h4><ul><li><p><strong>Authentication &amp; Authorization</strong>: 18 test cases</p></li><li><p><strong>Order Lifecycle Management</strong>: 45 test cases ⭐ (Most Critical)</p></li><li><p><strong>MSISDN/ICCID Management</strong>: 25 test cases</p></li><li><p><strong>Document Verification</strong>: 22 test cases</p></li><li><p><strong>Payment Processing</strong>: 20 test cases</p></li><li><p><strong>Background Jobs</strong>: 15 test cases</p></li><li><p><strong>External Integrations</strong>: 12 test cases</p></li><li><p><strong>API Endpoints</strong>: 18 test cases</p></li><li><p><strong>Admin Functions</strong>: 15 test cases</p></li><li><p><strong>Edge Cases &amp; Error Handling</strong>: 20 test cases</p></li></ul><h4>By Priority:</h4><ul><li><p><strong>Critical</strong>: 95 test cases (45%)</p></li><li><p><strong>High</strong>: 75 test cases (36%)</p></li><li><p><strong>Medium</strong>: 30 test cases (14%)</p></li><li><p><strong>Low</strong>: 10 test cases (5%)</p></li></ul><h4>Automation Target:</h4><ul><li><p><strong>Overall</strong>: 71% automation coverage</p></li><li><p><strong>Critical Features</strong>: 85-90% automated</p></li><li><p><strong>Medium Priority</strong>: 60-70% automated</p></li><li><p><strong>Manual Testing</strong>: 29% (exploratory, UX, edge cases)</p></li></ul><hr /><h2>🔧 Test Environment Setup</h2><h3>Prerequisites</h3><h4>Required Software</h4><ac:structured-macro ac:name="code" ac:schema-version="1" ac:macro-id="865fbcf3-4a46-47b9-be96-b5e591a772b3"><ac:parameter ac:name="language">bash</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[# Ruby and Rails
Ruby 3.2+
Rails 8.0+

# Databases
PostgreSQL 14+ (primary database)
MySQL 8.0+ (IDE users database)
Redis 6+ (Sidekiq, caching)

# Node.js (for assets)
Node.js 18+
Yarn 1.22+]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h4>Test Database Setup</h4><ac:structured-macro ac:name="code" ac:schema-version="1" ac:macro-id="8048f926-96b2-4061-a1bd-e4820dcb7f7e"><ac:parameter ac:name="language">bash</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[# Navigate to ide-phoenix directory
cd /Users/rorikurniadi/code/smb-app/ide-phoenix

# Install dependencies
bundle install
yarn install

# Setup test database
RAILS_ENV=test bin/rails db:create
RAILS_ENV=test bin/rails db:migrate
RAILS_ENV=test bin/rails db:seed

# Verify setup
RAILS_ENV=test bin/rails db:version]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><hr /><h2>📝 Key Test Cases (Examples)</h2><h3>TC-AUTH-001: Successful Login - Sales User ⭐</h3><table data-layout="default"><tbody><tr><th><p>Attribute</p></th><th><p>Details</p></th></tr><tr><td><p><strong>Priority</strong></p></td><td><p>🔴 Critical</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>Type</strong></p></td><td><p>Functional, Security</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>Role</strong></p></td><td><p>Sales</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>Test Steps:</strong></p><ol start="1"><li><p>Navigate to login page: <code>/portal/users/sign_in</code></p></li><li><p>Enter valid credentials (<a href="mailto:sales@test.com">sales@test.com</a> / Test1234!)</p></li><li><p>Click &quot;Sign In&quot; button</p></li><li><p>Verify redirect to <code>/portal/sales/dashboard</code></p></li><li><p>Verify session cookie creation</p></li><li><p>Verify Google Analytics tracking</p></li><li><p>Verify role-based permissions</p></li></ol><p><strong>Expected Result:</strong> User successfully logged in with proper session and GA tracking.</p><hr /><h3>TC-ORDER-003: MSISDN Stage - FIFO Auto-Population ⭐⭐⭐</h3><table data-layout="default"><tbody><tr><th><p>Attribute</p></th><th><p>Details</p></th></tr><tr><td><p><strong>Priority</strong></p></td><td><p>🔴 Critical</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>Type</strong></p></td><td><p>Functional, Integration</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>Role</strong></p></td><td><p>Sales</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>Test Steps:</strong></p><ol start="1"><li><p>Navigate to MSISDN stage after completing customer stage</p></li><li><p>Verify auto-population triggers using FIFO logic (oldest created_at first)</p></li><li><p>Verify 5 MSISDN fields populated automatically</p></li><li><p>Verify 5 ICCID fields populated automatically</p></li><li><p>Verify only 'available' resources selected (no reserved/activated)</p></li><li><p>Verify dealer/location filtering</p></li><li><p>Verify no duplicates present</p></li></ol><p><strong>Expected Result:</strong> MSISDNs and ICCIDs automatically populated in FIFO order, respecting constraints.</p><hr /><h3>TC-ORDER-004: Manual MSISDN Override with Duplicate Detection ⭐⭐</h3><table data-layout="default"><tbody><tr><th><p>Attribute</p></th><th><p>Details</p></th></tr><tr><td><p><strong>Priority</strong></p></td><td><p>🔴 Critical</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>Type</strong></p></td><td><p>Functional, Integration</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>Role</strong></p></td><td><p>Sales</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>Test Steps:</strong></p><ol start="1"><li><p>Load MSISDN stage with auto-populated values</p></li><li><p>Click dropdown to manually change MSISDN #3</p></li><li><p>Select new MSISDN from searchable dropdown</p></li><li><p>Verify real-time duplicate detection (onChange event)</p></li><li><p>Attempt to select duplicate MSISDN from another field</p></li><li><p>Verify error message and visual indication (red highlight)</p></li><li><p>Verify submit button disabled while duplicate exists</p></li><li><p>Correct duplicate and verify error clears</p></li></ol><p><strong>Expected Result:</strong> Real-time duplicate detection prevents errors with immediate visual feedback.</p><hr /><h2>🤖 Automation Strategy</h2><h3>Technology Stack</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Unit/Integration</strong>: RSpec, FactoryBot, SimpleCov</p></li><li><p><strong>E2E Testing</strong>: Playwright (TypeScript)</p></li><li><p><strong>API Testing</strong>: RSpec request specs</p></li><li><p><strong>Performance</strong>: Apache JMeter, k6</p></li><li><p><strong>CI/CD</strong>: GitLab CI</p></li></ul><h3>Automation Coverage by Feature</h3><table data-layout="default"><tbody><tr><th><p>Feature Category</p></th><th><p>Priority</p></th><th><p>Automation Target</p></th><th><p>Tools</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>Authentication</p></td><td><p>Critical</p></td><td><p>90%</p></td><td><p>RSpec + Playwright</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Order Lifecycle</p></td><td><p>Critical</p></td><td><p>85%</p></td><td><p>RSpec + Playwright</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>MSISDN Selection</p></td><td><p>Critical</p></td><td><p>90%</p></td><td><p>RSpec + Playwright</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Document Verification</p></td><td><p>High</p></td><td><p>70%</p></td><td><p>RSpec + Playwright</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Payment Processing</p></td><td><p>Critical</p></td><td><p>60%</p></td><td><p>RSpec (webhooks manual)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Background Jobs</p></td><td><p>High</p></td><td><p>80%</p></td><td><p>RSpec</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>External APIs</p></td><td><p>High</p></td><td><p>60%</p></td><td><p>RSpec (mocked)</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Sample Playwright Test Structure</h3><ac:structured-macro ac:name="code" ac:schema-version="1" ac:macro-id="32453cc4-e17f-4480-b3be-f7e9e48315f2"><ac:parameter ac:name="language">typescript</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[// tests/order-creation.spec.ts
import { test, expect } from '@playwright/test';

test.describe('Order Creation Flow', () => {
  test('TC-ORDER-001: Create order as Sales user', async ({ page }) => {
    // Login
    await page.goto('/portal/users/sign_in');
    await page.fill('[name="user[email]"]', 'sales@test.com');
    await page.fill('[name="user[password]"]', 'Test1234!');
    await page.click('button[type="submit"]');

    // Verify dashboard
    await expect(page).toHaveURL('/portal/sales/dashboard');

    // Create order
    await page.click('text=Create New Order');
    await page.selectOption('select[name="order[product_id]"]', '1');
    await page.fill('[name="order[quantity]"]', '5');
    await page.click('button:has-text("Create Order")');

    // Verify order created
    await expect(page).toHaveURL(/\/portal\/sales\/orders\/\d+\/customer_stage/);
    await expect(page.locator('.alert-success')).toContainText('Order created successfully');
  });
});]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><hr /><h2>📅 Test Execution Schedule</h2><h3>Sprint-Based Testing (14-week cycle)</h3><table data-layout="default"><tbody><tr><th><p>Sprint</p></th><th><p>Week</p></th><th><p>Focus Area</p></th><th><p>Test Cases</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>Sprint 1</p></td><td><p>1-2</p></td><td><p>Authentication &amp; Authorization</p></td><td><p>TC-AUTH-001 to TC-AUTH-018</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Sprint 2</p></td><td><p>3-4</p></td><td><p>Order Creation &amp; Customer Stage</p></td><td><p>TC-ORDER-001 to TC-ORDER-015</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Sprint 3</p></td><td><p>5-6</p></td><td><p>MSISDN/ICCID Management</p></td><td><p>TC-ORDER-016 to TC-MSISDN-025</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Sprint 4</p></td><td><p>7-8</p></td><td><p>Document Verification</p></td><td><p>TC-DOC-001 to TC-DOC-022</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Sprint 5</p></td><td><p>9-10</p></td><td><p>Payment &amp; Activation</p></td><td><p>TC-PAY-001 to TC-ACTIVATION-020</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Sprint 6</p></td><td><p>11-12</p></td><td><p>Background Jobs &amp; APIs</p></td><td><p>TC-JOB-001 to TC-API-018</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Sprint 7</p></td><td><p>13-14</p></td><td><p>Admin Functions &amp; Edge Cases</p></td><td><p>TC-ADMIN-001 to TC-EDGE-020</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Continuous Testing</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Daily</strong>: Automated regression suite (critical paths)</p></li><li><p><strong>Weekly</strong>: Full automation suite execution</p></li><li><p><strong>Sprint</strong>: Manual exploratory testing</p></li><li><p><strong>Release</strong>: Complete test suite + performance testing</p></li></ul><hr /><h2>📈 Test Metrics &amp; Reporting</h2><h3>Key Metrics to Track</h3><ol start="1"><li><p><strong>Test Coverage</strong>: % of code covered by tests (target: 80%+)</p></li><li><p><strong>Automation Rate</strong>: % of test cases automated (target: 71%)</p></li><li><p><strong>Pass Rate</strong>: % of tests passing (target: 95%+)</p></li><li><p><strong>Defect Density</strong>: Bugs per 1000 LOC (target: &lt;5)</p></li><li><p><strong>Test Execution Time</strong>: Total time to run full suite (target: &lt;30 min)</p></li></ol><h3>Reporting Template</h3><ac:structured-macro ac:name="code" ac:schema-version="1" ac:macro-id="7f3844b1-346c-4067-8556-278cfcf64dd2"><ac:parameter ac:name="language">markdown</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[## Test Execution Report - Sprint X

